stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OK : Monthly budget defined (limit > 0)

    OK --> WARNING : Expense recorded\n[spent >= 80% limit && spent < 100%]\n(Emit WARNING alert)
    OK --> EXCEEDED : Large expense recorded\n[spent >= 100% limit]\n(Emit EXCEEDED alert)

    WARNING --> EXCEEDED : Further expense recorded\n[spent >= 100% limit]\n(Emit EXCEEDED alert)
    WARNING --> WARNING : Expense recorded\n[spent < 100% limit]\n(No duplicate alert)

    EXCEEDED --> EXCEEDED : Further expense recorded\n(No duplicate alert)

    %% Hysteresis transitions per Decision D-28
    WARNING --> OK : Expense reduced/deleted\n[spent < 80% limit]\n(Reset alert state)
    EXCEEDED --> OK : Expense reduced/deleted\n[spent < 80% limit]\n(Reset alert state)
    EXCEEDED --> WARNING : Expense reduced/deleted\n[80% <= spent < 100% limit]\n(Rearm EXCEEDED alert)

    note right of WARNING
        Decision D-09 & D-28:
        Alerts emitted via Observer pattern (never exceptions).
        Hysteresis resets alert status only when spending drops
        below the 80% warning threshold.
    end note
